- [ ] Random waves / spectra (`wave.random`, later)
- [ ] Other modules: dimensionless, hydrostatics, bernoulli, open_channel

## References

- Dean & Dalrymple, *Water Wave Mechanics for Engineers and Scientists*
- Stoker, *Water Waves*
- Holthuijsen, *Waves in Oceanic and Coastal Waters*
- Fenton (1985), *A fifth-order Stokes theory for steady waves*, ASCE J. Waterway, Port, Coastal and Ocean Eng.

